{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","bgm":"stop","item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/51170_storyselect_kuroe/51170_neomagius_title.jpg","posX":0,"posY":0,"visible":"appear"}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.4,"se":"3201_heal","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":1.8,"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/51170_storyselect_kuroe/51170_neomagius_title.jpg","visible":"hide"}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnChangeInTime":1.0},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_24013.jpg","bgm":"stop","nameNarration":"","narrationCoverOpacity":0.0,"narrationEffect":"in"},{"armatureList":[{"animation":["action"],"armatureId":1,"filePath":"resource/image_native/effect/story/general/3003_act_picture.ExportJson","zOrder":"messageBack"}],"autoTurnLast":0.1},{"bgm":"bgm05_event11","narration":"There is one star that remains@a wonder to this world.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"Legend has it that it exists just@beyond the edge of the universe...   "},{"narration":"People began to call it the \"Wishing Star\", for it@was said to be able to make dreams come true..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21731.jpg","narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"deleteArmatureList":[1]},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"nameNarration":"","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21731.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"<Takarazaki City Community Center>","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21741.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"...Whatcha up to, Miyurin? You've been glued@to your phone this whole time.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Um, uh, I've been playing \"Little Vacation\"...!"},{"chara":[{"id":103201}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"It's a mobile game that used to be popular@in the Wings of the Magius."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"I haven't played it in a loooong time,@and I started feeling nostalgic about it."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"I heard it was created by Lady Touka and some@other girls... I think...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"...A game made by the Magius? What's it like?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Well, um, we can watch AI versions of ourselves,"},{"chara":[{"id":103201}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"while they live in a slightly more fantasy-like@fictional world."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"You mean it's a game where you just, like,@stare at it? Kyaha, that's too funny!★"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Can this cutie take a peek?@[chara:102801:lipSynch_0][wait:1.8]…[chara:102801:lipSynch_1][chara:102801:cheek_0][chara:102801:face_mtn_ex_040.exp3.json][chara:102801:motion_300]Wait, how come it's snowing?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"That's because... It's set up as a world where@Christmas lasts forever!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"So that's Miyurin's AI, huh...@Is that the Instructor beside you?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Yeah, yeah! My AI is with Lady San right now,"},{"chara":[{"id":103201}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"and we're heading to a place called Kosho Junk@City..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"[chara:103201:effect_emotion_joy_0][se:7222_happy]Which means I can stare at virtual Lady San's@sacred legs as much as I want!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Horny level MAX, LMAO."},{"autoTurnLast":0.4,"bgm":"stop","nameCenter":"San's Voice","textCenter":"...Princess, Miyu, we've all arrived."},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801}]},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":2.3,"bg":"bg_adv_21741.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan","bgm":"bgm03_story20","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":0,"pos":2}]},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103501}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textCenter":"[chara:103201:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]*Gasp*?!@[wait:2][chara:103201:lipSynch_1][chara:103201:cheek_0][chara:103201:motion_200]La-La-La-Lady San?!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":1,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","textRight":"Sorry to keep you waiting, Hime.♪@Let's get the meeting started."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103501}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id