ght":"(Shigure has spent every day staring up@at the night sky.)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103000,"motion":100,"pos":2},{"id":102900,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"I bet those two have reached the angels' world@beyond the stars,"},{"chara":[{"id":103000}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"and are still busy bringing smiles to everyone's faces...right?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"Yeah... I'm sure they'll let us know they're fine."},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"...They promised they would."},{"autoTurnLast":1.0,"bg":"bg_adv_21075.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120302,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"sepiaFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":120301}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"Someday, when we safely reach the angels'@world,","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":201}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"we'll show you guys shooting stars from@the other side."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_20645.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102900,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103000,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103000,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"That's right! I really hope they're okay,[chara:103000:lipSynch_0][wait:1.5][chara:103000:lipSynch_1][chara:103000:cheek_0][chara:103000:face_mtn_ex_030.exp3.json][chara:103000:eyeClose_1][chara:103000:motion_300] but...","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":1.2,"bg":"bg_adv_16043.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"sepiaFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":102900,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"The most probable result is...you'd be thrown@into the void...and extinguished in the end.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"Knowing this, would you still want to go to@the real \"End of the World\"?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"Yup!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120302,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Felicia","textRight":"Duh, that's obvious!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.3,"bg":"bg_adv_20645.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103000,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":103000,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"...[wait:2][chara:103000:lipSynch_1][chara:103000:eyeClose_0][chara:103000:motion_1]Hey, Shigure.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":103000}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"...What do you think they meant when they said@they'd show us shooting stars?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"...I dunno, but..."},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"Maybe they'll send a signal from the other side@of the Wishing Star."},{"chara":[{"id":102900,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"That's why I'm keeping watch like this."},{"chara":[{"id":103000,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"Yeah... You might be right."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102900,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"..."},{"chara":[{"id":103000,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"...You look worn out, Shigure."},{"chara":[{"id":103000,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"You're still...worried about them, aren't you?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"Yeah...@I don't think that's the only reason, though."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103000,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"...Maybe you're tired from staring up at the sky@day in and day out...?"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102900,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"..."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"I've always longed for the angels' world@beyond the Wishing Star."},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"I wanna reach out to the Three Magi who live@there..."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"...The beings who created this place."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103000,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"Me too..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102900}]},{"chara":[{"id":102900,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"But that dream's already come true."},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"The Three Magi didn't answer,"},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"but I'm sure they heard our voices, right?"},{"chara":[{"id":102900}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"And then we sent both Santas to the angels'@world after all of that."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102900,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Shigure","textLeft":"Maybe they lost steam since they don't have@a goal anymore...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103000,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"..."},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"de